  "notes": {
    "remote_desktop": "Remote Desktop mirrors the CC:Tweaked terminal and forwards keyboard and real mouse events. Normal remote administration requires the target to enable Remote Access and share its access code.",
    "file_transfer": "Remote file transfer is restricted to /public; files are limited to 8192 bytes.",
    "mail": "HackOS internal mail uses rednet between reachable computers; it is not external SMTP or Gmail.",
    "recovery": "Installer stores recovery copies under /hackos/recovery/files. Deleting a system file triggers a blue-screen-style recovery flow. Press R to restore missing files or run rescue.lua from CraftOS.",
    "exploit_lab": "Government includes a deliberately fictional Minecraft-only KLOS-BOOT-OVERWRITE exploit against KL OS Standard 2.4.0+. It ignores that OS normal Remote Access and Security Center settings, removes only an OS file, and forces local recovery. It is not a general-purpose exploit."
